[Trigger]
Name	shiftBell
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The Tinmoor miners know every shaft and every seam, my lord, and the warden sits behind two of their watch posts. You have little gold, so start with the seams.
Action	objective	1	Kill Warden Merrin Tay in her chamber at the top of the mine.
Action	objective	1	Mine 900 gold from the tin seams.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	seamsFilled
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	900
Action	message	1	That is a good haul. Doors will keep the miners off your back.
Action	reveal	1	PostA
Action	objective	1	Break the lower watch post in the east gallery.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	postAEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	PostA
Action	message	1	The first post is awake. Hold the shaft and let them come to you.
Action	spawn	3	49	28	1	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Dwarf1:2
Action	setflag	postAAlarm	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	postACleared
Mode	once
Cond	flag	postAAlarm	1
Cond	kills	1	>=	7
Action	message	1	The lower post is silent. A lift shaft leads up to the second one.
Action	reveal	1	PostB
Action	objective	1	Break the upper watch post below the warden.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	postBEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	PostB
Action	message	1	Merrin Tay has heard you. Her best are in that post.
Action	spawn	3	58	15	1	Knight:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2
Action	reveal	1	Chamber
Action	setflag	postBAlarm	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	vaultFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SealedVault
Action	message	1	This chamber was closed off long ago. A smooth grey stone hums in the dust, and a stray goblin has picked it up. Bring it to your dungeon heart.
Action	spawn	1	66	50	1	Goblin:1@VaultBearer
Action	stoneattach	VaultBearer
Action	setflag	vaultStone	1
Action	timer	vaultSpawn	0
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	vaultStoneHome
Mode	once
Cond	reached	VaultBearer	heart	1
Action	message	1	The stone sinks into the heart and a hidden hall has opened.
Action	discover	campaign/BoulderCourse.level
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	vaultStoneLost
Mode	repeat	60
Cond	flag	vaultStone	1
Cond	timer	vaultSpawn	>=	5
Cond	alive	VaultBearer	0
Action	message	1	The stone-bearer has fallen. Another goblin has taken the stone in the vault.
Action	spawn	1	66	50	1	Goblin:1@VaultBearer
Action	stoneattach	VaultBearer
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstShift
